@title Place macro: the PLC input card says it is symbols only and where to get a card
@area Schematic
# Critical audit C-59: the macro registered no card, so the I/O list stayed empty with no explanation.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "place macro"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click 237 94
text plc input card
wait 5
click_text "PLC input card" Label
wait 10
expect "Symbols only"
shot macro-picked
click_text Place Button
wait 20
expect_scene "-A2"
expect "Symbols only"
shot macro-placed
check_layout
